      "content": "idk i feel like i'm just overreacting a bit. my cousin had something similar and it was just eye strain from too much blue light. are you sure it's a \"medical emergency\"? it just feels like a nuisance. if i just took some high dose ibuprofen or maybe some of those vitamin eye supplements i have in the cabinet, would that not be enough to calm the inflammation down? i just really need to get through this deadline without my vision going crazy.",
